  "ruleText": "Agr 908.02 Scope. The rules in this part shall apply to any sawmill which processes native lumber for sale in the state and chooses to participate in this program.\n\nSource. #6171, eff 1-24-96, EXPIRED: 1-24-04\n\nNew. #14550, eff 4-1-26, EXPIRES: 4-1-36",
